        "claim": "Official figures show that higher consumer spending typically does not fully offset the costs from businesses closing.",
        "evidence_id": "E14",
        "quote": "official figures often show that the benefits from higher consumer spending do not fully outweigh the costs from businesses closing"
      },
      {
