        "claim": "Bank holidays can positively impact staff morale, wellbeing, and work-life balance, potentially leading to increased productivity in the long run.",
        "evidence_id": "E17",
        "quote": "Bank holidays provide workers with an additional day off, which can positively impact staff morale, well-being, and work-life balance, potentially leading to increased productivity in the long run"
      },
      {
        "tier": "projected",
        "claim": "Manufacturing and construction sectors may experience significant losses from extra holidays.",
        "evidence_id": "E10",
        "quote": "Manufacturing and construction sectors, in particular, may experience significant losses, especially if an extra day off leads to a whole week being lost for some operations"
      }
